# Repo files that are not part of the public site (index.html, style.css, script.js,
# favicon.ico, arts/ and assets/). Vercel documents .vercelignore for CLI deploys; for
# GitHub-triggered deploys, .gitignore is what reliably keeps files off the site, so
# nothing sensitive relies on this list. None of these files hold personal data.

